 style="fill:none" d="M -94.64 -81.49 L -22.49 -126.6"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(0.84795 -0.5301 0.5301 0.84795 -24.6 -125.28)"><path d="M 6.34 0 L 1.12 1.95 L 2.66 0 L 1.12 -1.95 Z"></path></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 94.26 -81.49 L 22.1 -126.6"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(-0.84795 -0.5301 0.5301 -0.84795 24.21 -125.28)"><path d="M 6.34 0 L 1.12 1.95 L 2.66 0 L 1.12 -1.95 Z"></path></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Context lattice for two overlapping contexts. Each arrow denotes set inclusion.</span></figcaption>
