<section id="S9" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">9 </span>Solver: Curvature-Aware Backtracking</h2>

<div id="S9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We prototype <span id="S9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">CBL-Solve</span>, a backtracking solver with overlap propagation.
Assignments propagate within contexts; overlaps are checked, and contradictions prune early.</p>
</div>
<section id="S9.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">9.1 </span>Pseudocode</h3>

<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>CBL-Solve: curvature-aware backtracking</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span><math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math> with context map <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>, family <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>SAT/UNSAT and compatible family <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\ell_{C}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\ell_{C}\}</annotation></semantics></math> if SAT
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
            Initialize <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{C}</annotation></semantics></math> empty for each <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math>; overlap table <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{OVL}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖮𝖵𝖫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{OVL}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.4.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">true</em> <span id="algorithm1.4.4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.4.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.5.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">all clauses satisfied &amp; overlaps agree</em> <span id="algorithm1.4.5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.4.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> SAT
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
            end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6</span></span>
            pick literal <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> by VSIDS+overlap heuristic
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.4.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.9.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> containing <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">8</span></span>
            assign <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{C}</annotation></semantics></math>; propagate unit clauses
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.4.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.11.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">exists <math id="algorithm1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\cap C^{\prime}\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\cap C^{\prime}\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> and overlap violated</em> <span id="algorithm1.4.11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.4.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">backtrack</span>; record curvature cut; continue
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">11</span></span>
            end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span></span>
            end foreach
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span></span>
            learn clauses/overlap cuts as in CDCL extended
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14</span></span>
            end while
</div>
